      "description": "A visible Arabic label, cream control, and adjacent invalid-state message.",
      "html": "<div class=\"ds-field\" dir=\"rtl\"><label for=\"ds-name\">الاسم <span>*</span></label><input id=\"ds-name\" placeholder=\"اسمك الكريم\" autocomplete=\"name\"><span class=\"ds-error\">يرجى إدخال الاسم</span></div>",
      "css": ".ds-field{font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Alexandria Variable\",sans-serif);display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:9px;color:var(--ink,#29141a);max-width:360px}.ds-field label{font-size:12px;font-weight:600}.ds-field label>span{color:var(--burgundy,#681e32)}.ds-field input{font-family:var(--font-sans,\"Alexandria Variable\",sans-serif);min-height:50px;border:1px solid var(--line-strong,#ae887b);border-radius:8px;background:var(--cream,#fbf2e1);font-size:12px;line-height:1.9;padding:12px 13px;color:var(--ink,#29141a);caret-color:var(--burgundy,#681e32);transition:border-color .15s}.ds-field input::placeholder{color:var(--muted,#6d514e);opacity:1}.ds-field input:focus{border-color:var(--burgundy,#681e32)}.ds-field input:focus-visible{outline:3px solid var(--burgundy,#681e32);outline-offset:5px;}.ds-field input[aria-invalid=true]{border-color:var(--burgundy,#681e32);background:#fff2ee}.ds-error{display:none;font-size:10px;line-height:1.9;color:var(--burgundy-deep,#41121f)}.ds-field input[aria-invalid=true]+.ds-error{display:block}"
